(LEGAL-010 - OPERATIVE CLAUSES & STATUTORY DIRECTIVES \(PAGE 2\)) Tj T*
(Title: T.K. Shanmugam v. State of Tamil Nadu \(2015 \(5\) LW 397 Full Bench\)  Invali) Tj T*
(Addressed / Competent Officer: Commissioner of Land Administration, District Collector & WRD Executive Engineer) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(CLAUSE 1: Para 40 & Para 45 \(Public Trust Doctrine on Shrinking Tanks\)) Tj T*
(The Full Bench ruled that shrinkage of a tank due to artificial blockage of inflow) Tj T*
(channels or urbanisation does not extinguish its character as a water body.) Tj T*
(Government Orders attempting to reclassify tank poramboke for housing or) Tj T*
(commercial allotment are unconstitutional and void.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(CLAUSE 2: Para 48 \(Strict Accountability of Revenue & WRD Officials\)) Tj T*
(Revenue and WRD officers who fail to act on complaints of tank-bed encroachment or) Tj T*
(who grant electricity/water connections to unauthorized structures inside tank) Tj T*
(boundaries are liable to departmental disciplinary proceedings.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
